    nodes [battery(left, %), motor(right, kW or — / Consuming|Regenerating|Standby)], charger(top, kW)
    appended while charging; arrows battery→motor (cyan, active when consuming) + motor→battery (emerald,
    active when regen) ALWAYS present (the web pushes both unconditionally), charger→battery (amber,
    active) appended while charging. power/charger_power consumed as kW with the web `?? 0` fallbacks;
    battery_level as %. Stroke ∝ magnitude (1..4); maxArrowValue floored at 1; compact keeps the 3
    largest (the widget itself renders non-compact, matching the web which passes no `compact`). Verified
    by an EXECUTED native binary (30/30) below.
